# 起名表单开着时系统退出（程序坞「退出」、注销、AppleScript quit 走的那条）：表单是游戏窗口上的 sheet，系统退出照样要先按「取消」关掉它、存盘、进程自己退出（码 0）。
# 手柄走到起名页（同 new_character_vkbd_mac.scn），再用键盘回车打开输入框：用键盘时弹的是表单而不是屏幕键盘
# A system quit (the path of Quit in the Dock, log out, AppleScript quit) while the naming sheet is up: the sheet sits on the game window, and the system quit must still
# answer "Cancel" to it, save and end the process by itself (code 0). The controller walks to the naming page (as new_character_vkbd_mac.scn), then Return on the keyboard
# opens the input box: with the keyboard it is the sheet, not the on-screen keyboard
name quit_with_name_sheet_mac
requires mac-app
save warlock
timeout 180

expect main_menu timeout=120
sleep 1
press PLUS
sleep 1
press DOWN
press A
expect_state panels~=CharacterCreatePanel timeout=20
sleep 1.5
press A
expect_state panels~=CharacterOptionsPanel timeout=10
sleep 1
press A
expect_state focus_panel=CharacterCreateNamePanel focus=InputText timeout=10
sleep 1
fe "0 skey 36"
sleep 2
system_quit
check exit 0
check no_red
